      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Downtown Gaffney features the Michael Gaffney Log Home, City Hall Park with a historic fountain, and the newly built City Hall.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityofgaffney-sc.gov/177/Marketing-Tourism",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 2009 the city secured a grant to buy the historic old post office, preserving a key piece of its civic heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityofgaffney-sc.gov/177/Marketing-Tourism",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Gaffney Visitors Center and Art Gallery, recognized in 2023 as an official stop on the Overmountain Victory National Historic Trail, offers live studio views.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
